### VetFlow JSON endpoints (sign in through the browser first – they use the auth cookie)
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7280

### Free 30-minute slots for veterinarian 1 tomorrow
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/slots?vetId=1&date=2026-10-23&duration=30

### Patient autocomplete
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/search?term=kar

### Health check (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
